<title>USA: Rohm and Haas files for $300 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Rohm and Haas files for $300 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rohm and Haas Co said on Friday that it filed a shelf registration to issue up to $300 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>The Philadelphia, Pa-based company said net proceeds will be added to the working capital of the company and will be used for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>The proceeds will also be used for the financing of a portion of the company's capital expenditure programs and possibly acquisitions, the filing.</p>
</text>
